tion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Countercharm Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Countercharm_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Countercharm_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Countercharm_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Countercharm_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Countercharm Aura (Condition)\"><b>Countercharm Aura</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>You and allies within 9 m (30 ft) have <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a> against being <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">Charmed</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a>.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Condition)\"><b>Invulnerable</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Countercharm</b> is an entity created by a bard's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Countercharm\" title=\"Countercharm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Countercharm_Icon.webp/20px-Countercharm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/48/Countercharm_Icon.webp/30px-Countercharm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/48/Countercharm_Icon.webp/40px-Countercharm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Countercharm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Countercharm_Icon.webp/20px-Countercharm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Countercharm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Countercharm\" title=\"Countercharm\">Countercharm</a> ability which manifests as an ethereal, floating music instrument. It takes the form of whatever instrument is equipped by the bard or a music box if none are. For its three round duration, it will perform <a href=\"/wiki/The_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Power\">The Power</a>.\n<p>It is immune to all damage and conditions. Nevertheless, the enemy AI may decide to target it fruitlessly, wasting their actions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Portrait variations</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 122px\">\n\t\t\